1080.jpg?t=1764422522","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/872060/ss_2299a7a85eadc7d662301d4bf8a8b85527ad64d2.600x338.jpg?t=1764422522"},{"id":11,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/872060/ss_aa1492f1d08a3f330f494809ec18ad06dc9b5574.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764422522","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/872060/ss_aa1492f1d08a3f330f494809ec18ad06dc9b5574.600x338.jpg?t=1764422522"},{"id":12,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/872060/ss_3a52eb2bfa0b7b73975c6a161bd944ad6c340e0e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764422522","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/872060/ss_3a52eb2bfa0b7b73975c6a161bd944ad6c340e0e.600x338.jpg?t=1764422522"},{"id":13,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/872060/ss_2e709f6ee10bc255f0acc937db5fce339092d534.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764422522","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/872060/ss_2e709f6ee10bc255f0acc937db5fce339092d534.600x338.jpg?t=1764422522"}],"short_description":"Quiet as a Stone is a meditative digital toy and landscape creator. Slash grass to reveal artifacts, mine stones for gems, craft &amp; photograph atmospheric vignettes in a realm defined by solitude, impermanence, and the quiet beauty of decay. Step into an autumnal world of dormant nature in minature.","steam_appid":872060,"support_info":{"email":"support@distantlantern.com","url":"www.distantlantern.com"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"http://www.quietasastone.com"}